  "details": "Description\n\nI have been having this issue since I first started playing VRC. After a while I can't see the instance friends or other users have joined. I need to restart VRC each time to update my list.\n\nMANY other people have the exact issue I do. I have disabled IPv6. I do not have a VPN. My VRC not running the beta.\n\nAny sense of solution or explanation would be greatly appreciated\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nI do not know how this issue occurs. I assume it has something to do with the API, the user's network connection and the user's router.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Networking\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-14_21-27-56.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_ab3591f5-62e6-461d-8fbc-a21836a705a5/1/file)",
